    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "This automated system acts as a Digital Auditor for your inbox. It monitors your emails, identifies audit documents, and organizes them so you don't have to.\n\n🛡️ What the Workflow Does\nMonitors & Filters: Constantly checks for new emails and ignores anything that isn't a specific audit request.\n\nExtracts & Labels: Scans the email subject to pull out the Client Name and Year, then attaches these details to the file.\n\nSecurity Triage: Inspects every document to see if it is password-protected before saving it.\n\nOrganized Storage: Moves open files to your main audit folder and isolates \"Locked\" files in a quarantine folder so they don't block your work.\n\nAutomated Follow-up: Instantly messages the sender if their file is locked, asking them for an unlocked version so you don't have to chase them manually.\n\nCentral Tracking: Logs every action, file link, and status update into a master Google Sheet for a clear bird's-eye view.\n\n📌 Sticker Note One-Liners\nIf Node: A security gate that separates \"Ready-to-Audit\" files from \"Locked\" ones.\n\nQuarantine: A safe zone for encrypted files to keep your main folders clean.\n\nAuto-Nudge: An instant notification to senders when they submit a password-protected file.\n\nAudit Trail: Every document's status is automatically logged in your master sheet.",
        "height": 656,
        "width": 560
      },
